    {
      "role": "section",
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "text-neutral-base light  max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto w-full theme-pad-80t md:theme-pad-96t lg:theme-pad-112t xl:theme-pad-1",
      "innerText": "The latest Redefining easy: the Xfinity Large Button Voice Remote Press-and-release voice control. Big, backlit buttons with haptic feedback. An easy-to-open battery door that stays attached. And a dedicated Accessibility shortcut key. Designed with people with disabilities in mind, the Xfinity Large Button Voice Remote is unlike anything available on the market today. See how it combines ultimate functionality with elegant design to offer something everyone can love. Discover your Xfinity Large Button Voice Remote",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "headings": [
        "The latest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "section",
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "mx-auto w-full  ",
      "innerText": "A better experience for customers who are blind or have low vision",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "headings": [
        "A better experience for customers who are blind or have low vision"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "section",
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "bg-cover bg-no-repeat bg-center xjs-layered-img px-6 lg:px-16 theme-pad-80b md:theme-pad-96b lg:theme-pad-112b xl:theme-",
      "innerText": "Let our guide do the talking Let voice guidance announce on-screen text and options on X1, Flex and the Xfinity Home touchscreen. Hear the action with audio description Bring entertainment to life for blind audiences with audio narration. Say “shows with description” to explore and “description” to turn it on or off. Bill and channel lineup in braille or large print Ask Xfinity Assistant how to get your braille or large-print versions at no cost.",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "headings": []
    },
    {
      "role": "section",
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "mx-auto w-full  ",
      "innerText": "Personalized solutions for customers who are deaf or hard of hearing",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "headings": [
        "Personalized solutions for customers who are deaf or hard of hearing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "section",
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "bg-cover bg-no-repeat bg-center xjs-layered-img px-6 lg:px-16",
      "innerText": "Customize your text size and color combinations on X1 and Flex Just say “captions” or press B to turn captions on or off. Bluetooth compatible Connect your favorite Bluetooth headphones, speakers, or hearing aid streamer right to our latest TV Boxes to manage your personal volume. Hearing-aid and RTT capable All Xfinity Mobile phones are hearing-aid compatible and real-time text (RTT) capable, so it’s easier to text like you talk.",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "headings": []
    },
    {
      "role": "section",
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "text-neutral-base light  patch-bg-grey-05 w-full",
      "innerText": "American Sign Language Support Center Learn more about the ASL support center, powered by CSD Connect Direct.",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "headings": [
        "American Sign Language Support Center"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "section",
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "mx-auto w-full  ",
      "innerText": "Innovation for customers with physical disabilities Control buttons and voice commands with eye tracking devices and the Xfinity Adaptive Remote web app. Navigate with a sip and puff switch, voice control computer software, or keyboard. Even create custom buttons.",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
      "headings": [
        "Innovation for customers with physical disabilities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "section",
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "text-neutral-base dark  max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto w-full theme-pad-80b md:theme-pad-96b lg:theme-pad-112b xl:theme-pad-12",
