  "body": [
    "Redefining easy: the Xfinity Large Button Voice Remote",
    "With our apps, you can use text to speech and other assistive technologies to stay connected to your entertainment and in control of your home network, even when you’re not there.",
    "Our voice remote, available with X1 and our Flex streaming TV box, puts revolutionary accessibility features one key press or voice command away. Say “accessibility” or press B to explore all options."
